Hi {!Contact.FirstName},

I hope your summer is going well. I wanted to reach out to you regarding your college plans to see if you are still interested in attending ASU. If you would like to attend it is not too late and we are happy to help you move forward, but if you are no longer interested in ASU then please officially cancel your admission online at this link: https://students.asu.edu/canceladmissions. This does require you to have activated your ASURITE ID. If you have not done that, you may instead send an email to decline@asu.edu with your full name, date of birth, the year and semester of the admission you are withdrawing, along with a statement indicating that you would like to withdraw your admission.

Please let us know if you have any questions about this process or your next steps for enrolling at ASU.

Sincerely,

